    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-incompatible-saddle-gaussian-target-curvature-det-b-0-kappa-0-2-kappa-0-0-42-cm-1> a schema:PropertyValue,
